    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Valerie Peebles",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100774701566853374751/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVfaI_KO1_pJLIHOnWbSdUlyZL3hkY4NftkohRZCdECIzk2Ey0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "I had the absolute pleasure of working with Johanne to fit a gown for the Grand Prix Gala this year, and she is truly an artist. Her attention to detail, craftsmanship, and eye for elegance transformed the dress into a perfect, custom piece. I felt amazing wearing it. She is incredibly talented and professional—highly recommend!",
        "time": 1753887406,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kelly Fraser",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101387803433922639393/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJQUFIDY_5ROVRQGnAN56EyhBpPJioAcu1vwKltgNAlbTsGBQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Johanne did the alterations on my daughter's wedding dress. She is absolutely incredible! My daughter's wedding dress looked absolutely spectacular. She went above and beyond to get it done in a timely manner. She honors her appointments, she is punctual. She is respectful, and listens to exactly what you want. And then she explains to you what can be done or how it should be done to make it look perfect. She is the definition of professional. Being the most important day of my daughter's life, I was so happy that it turned out so spectacularly. Her prices are also very reasonable. I highly highly highly recommend Johanne",
        "time": 1728700743,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Petronella Sibanda",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114092534214984735939/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJyq27xn-FSZrTzBrX9ZksaAyCyUyhkNAy53GcL1CJnECZEug=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Johanne is the best tailor ever and she does her job very well.",
        "time": 1758068743,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jaime",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101603663665370590365/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKz4XdOm2ZxGUhcE_OaxpBxVeEIGiYxHM_TMNR2fWFgdIEH=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Johanne is absolutely wonderful and I can’t recommend her strongly enough. She has good advice on what can be done with certain pieces, her work is quick and definitely reasonably priced, and most important it is truly excellent!  She altered my wedding dress, ahead of schedule even though I didn’t have much time, and it was perfect.  I would bring her anything without worry that she will do an amazing job on it!",
        "time": 1602017305,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "sherrylee1974",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102343353658042391922/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJAwSopdL7LFezCyQZfVDE0GnuodfdMtuu1oQOLuFPOKw1P3g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Johanne did an excellent job on the adjustments to my daughter’s dance costume.  The wrong size was received - two sizes too wide.  It was an intricate design with tons of sequins and Johanne made it fit like a glove.  She completely the job quickly, to ensure no delays for our upcoming competition.  She was very nice, professional and excellent workmanship.  I highly recommend her for all your tailoring needs.",
        "time": 1650664750,
        "translated": false
      }
